From a279a45a5ec091e13346aff61a9aeb47395bd542 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vamsi <vamsi@example.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 12:57:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add per-person donation QR page and pull-to-refresh gesture

- New public Donations page: shows one card per committee member/admin
  with their own donation QR photo (only members who have one uploaded)
- ManageCommittee admin page: added a QR photo upload field per member,
  separate from their profile photo, with preview and a set/not-set badge
- New qr_url column on committee_members (supabase/13_donation_qr.sql),
  reuses the existing public gallery storage bucket/policies
- getCommittee() now returns each member's public QR image URL
- Added /donations route + nav entry in More, with EN/TE translations
- New PullToRefresh component: pulling down from the top of any public
  page reloads the app (standard pull-to-refresh gesture)
